WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:01.382
Next comes the mirror.

00:00:01.707 --> 00:00:05.689
Ask the agent to repeat back the goal, people, desired

00:00:05.724 --> 00:00:09.787
experience, constraints, assumptions, and open questions.

00:00:10.298 --> 00:00:13.618
In our example, it might say, "An organizer submits

00:00:13.688 --> 00:00:17.740
details; the performer sees one inquiry and can mark it as

00:00:17.798 --> 00:00:21.827
needing a reply or handled." You can correct it: "Yes, but

00:00:21.873 --> 00:00:24.033
I want to decide what to send myself.

00:00:24.358 --> 00:00:27.794
Do not send emails automatically." The important thing is

00:00:27.829 --> 00:00:31.150
that the agent describes behavior you can recognize: who

00:00:31.208 --> 00:00:34.215
does what, in what order, and what result they see.
